The following issues require manual code changes:
  ./service.go:18:15: connect.NewError keeps only the message of fmt.Errorf("wrap: %w", context.Cause(ctx)); errors.Is and errors.As no longer reach it. Assign it to a variable and attach it with WithCause.
  ./service.go:21:15: connect.NewError keeps only the message of fmt.Errorf("%w then %w", err, err); errors.Is and errors.As no longer reach it. Assign it to a variable and attach it with WithCause.

Scanned 1 Go file and 0 Buf templates. 1 rewrite(s) ready (rerun with -w to apply).
